{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022b.q34.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下面材料，根据要求完成教学设计。一切从实际出发，实事求是必须坚持一切从实际出发，实事求是。我们做事情要尊重物质运动的客观规律，从客观存在的事物出发，经过调查研究，找出事物本身固有的而不是臆造的规律性，作为我们行动的依据。一切从实际出发，实事求是，要求我们充分发挥主观能动性，不断解放思想，与时俱进，以求真务实的精神探求事物的本质和规律，用科学的理论武装头脑、指导实践。一切从实际出发，实事求是，要求我们把发挥主观能动性和尊重客观规律结合起来，把高度的革命热情同严谨踏实的科学态度结合起来。既要反对夸大意识能动作用的唯意志主义，又要反对片面强调客观条件，安于现状、因循守旧、无所作为的思想。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bea5f947a4dab81bb799efe867520fe2eac9a95af3ea7ff5b901bee7b10f63fa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4841, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5137, "next_source_question_number": 35, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bea5f947a4dab81bb799efe867520fe2eac9a95af3ea7ff5b901bee7b10f63fa"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022b.q34"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.409.r002", "ntce.outline.409.r003", "ntce.outline.409.r005", "ntce.outline.409.r006", "ntce.outline.409.r009", "ntce.outline.409.r012"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.zhengzhi.2022b.q34"], "word_count": 296, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "zhengzhi", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《高中政治》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bea5f947a4dab81bb799efe867520fe2eac9a95af3ea7ff5b901bee7b10f63fa", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4841, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5137, "next_source